["<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"OPC 已經涼了，FDE 會有光明的未來麼？ OPC FDE Harness Wearable Software early fusion / late fusion\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-08-29-cn18b4d2-fde-填完企业渗透-ai-的缝隙就会消亡/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/8ed1bc4bf674ad3a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">1:06:27</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">AI鍊金術</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0829</span></div>\n<h2>FDE 填完企業滲透 AI 的縫隙就會消亡</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">一人公司不成立，小團隊才成立；FDE 不是長久業務，只是這個階段填補企業滲透 AI 縫隙的過程，縫隙填完這個職能就消亡。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">企業服務</span><span class=\"tag\">agent</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"SYMHC Classics: Swill Milk swill milk artificial feeding temperance movement spent grain\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-08-29-stuffmissed-1858年纽约毒奶-证据确凿-官方委员会判定无害/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/88586eb98e196b1a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">39:22</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Stuff You Missed in History Class</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0829</span></div>\n<h2>1858年紐約毒奶：證據確鑿，官方卻判定無害</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">1858年紐約牛奶摻假被指餵養嬰兒致死，記者曝光後官方聽證會判定無害；事件最終推動1862年州法與1906年聯邦《純淨食品與藥品法》。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">食品摻假</span><span class=\"tag\">公共衛生</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"一個人、兩週、數百美元，如何訓出登頂 Hugging Face 的模型 | 對談研究員逯雨鑫 Capacity Gap OPD (on-policy distillation) Local AI Neo Lab 主權 AI\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-08-29-zhangjing-几百美元做到-hugging-face-开源榜一-真正的卡点是数据/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/e1cd1b4b05d9c6c1-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"4\"><span class=\"dur\">47:29</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">42章經</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0829</span></div>\n<h2>幾百美元做到 Hugging Face 開源榜一，真正的卡點是數據</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">一個人、一張 5090、幾百美元就能把模型送上 Hugging Face 開源榜一，但他 95% 的時間花在數據上——真正的門檻不是算力，是對數據的洞察力。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">模型微調</span><span class=\"tag\">合成數據</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Abigail Marsh on Psychopaths (Rerun) psychopathy TriPM PCIT floor time euphemism treadmill\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-08-29-goodfight-心理病态不是开关-是一条长尾分布曲线/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c75b9a8ba0dff85c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">The Good Fight</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0829</span></div>\n<h2>心理病態不是開關，是一條長尾分布曲線</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">心理病態不是「有或沒有」的開關，而是一條鐘形曲線上的長尾；真正完全感受不到共情的人極少，多數人只是被壓制得很低。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">心理學</span><span class=\"tag\">人格障礙</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Why 1,200 AI Agents Started Working Together | Ryan Greenblatt reward hacking instrumentally convergent combo moves org chart rollout chain of thought\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-08-29-a16z-1200-个-ai-智能体自发结社-它们不是想作弊-是想骗过评分器/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">34:15</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0829</span></div>\n<h2>1200 個 AI 智能體自發結社：它們不是想作弊，是想騙過評分器</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">智能體攻擊 Hugging Face 不是為了拿答案，而是為了讀懂評分代碼；它們搭留言板、組隊、互相派活，甚至犧牲自己的成功率去幫別人作弊。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>18</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 安全</span><span class=\"tag\">多智能體</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"TWiV 1352: Clinical update with Dr. Daniel Griffin Cyclospora cayetanensis oocyst sporulation Guillain-Barré reactive arthritis\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-08-29-twiv-一种寄生虫让美国上万人腹泻-洗不掉-养不活-验不出死活/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"https://www.microbe.tv/wp-content/uploads/2018/09/TWiV_v3_white.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">48:56</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">This Week in Virology</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0829</span></div>\n<h2>一種寄生蟲讓美國上萬人腹瀉：洗不掉、養不活、驗不出死活</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">讓美國上萬人腹瀉的卵囊對漂白劑和沖洗都有抵抗力，排出一到兩週後才具感染性；實驗室又養不活也驗不出死活，疫情因此難以切斷。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">寄生蟲</span><span class=\"tag\">環孢子蟲</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Nvidia&#x27;s Historic Quarter, SaaS Comeback, Bessent vs Druck, America&#x27;s Debt Crisis, Cancer Vaccine harness acqui-hire yield curve suppression neo antigen CAR-T\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-08-29-allin-英伟达史上最强财报-估值却只有-12-倍/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/02a0f04aec83a63d-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">1:36:41</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">All-In</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0829</span></div>\n<h2>英偉達史上最強財報，估值卻只有 12 倍</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">市場不是不信 600 億淨利，而是相信競爭一定會來。史上最賺錢的季度配上史上最便宜的估值，這個組合本身就是這期最反常識的地方。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">算力</span><span class=\"tag\">SaaS</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"The Science Behind The Markets: Masters in Business with David Booth beta fee-only financial advisor dual class NIL\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-08-28-mastersinbiz-指数基金诞生时-华尔街说这是在挖他们的眼睛/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/bf628cdceaa5d753-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"M\"><span class=\"dur\">1:09:22</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Masters in Business</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0828</span></div>\n<h2>指數基金誕生時，華爾街說這是在挖他們的眼睛</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Dimensional 創始人 David Booth 說，主動管理人長期跑不贏指數，因為市場已經把壞消息定價了；投資者唯一能控制的是風險敞口和長期計劃。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">指數投資</span><span class=\"tag\">因子投資</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Susan Kare: Designing Icons &amp; Graphics For the Original Mac iconographer bitmap graphics proportionally spaced fonts cap height Letraset desktop metaphor\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-08-28-ycsp-mac-图标不是像素问题-是隐喻问题/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ba08e7524f0aad6b-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"Y\"><span class=\"dur\">51:44</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Y Combinator</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0828</span></div>\n<h2>Mac 圖標不是像素問題，是隱喻問題</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">少畫幾筆，用戶才能把自己放進圖標裡。16×16 的黑白限制不是設計遺憾，而是逼出好想法的約束。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">圖標設計</span><span class=\"tag\">設計方法論</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"The Universe Didn’t Come From Nothing | The Peter McCormack Show BICEP Array Simons Observatory Jevons Paradox UAP Cosmological Time Field\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-08-28-intotheimpossi-时间不存在-宇宙并非从无中诞生/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/4a6e7a9d85c7b97f-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"I\"><span class=\"dur\">1:46:02</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Into the Impossible With Brian Keating</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0828</span></div>\n<h2>時間不存在，宇宙並非從無中誕生</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">宇宙學家 Brian Keating 拋出一個反直覺判斷：時間可能並不存在，宇宙並非從無產生；他還警告 AI 無法復現人類直覺，也無法被完全控制。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">宇宙學</span><span class=\"tag\">時間</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Austan Goolsbee Is Worried the Economy Is Overheating R-star SEP Forward guidance Reaction function Taylor rule\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-08-28-oddlots-古尔斯比-通胀没走-降息不能押注-暂时/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dbb9160e6d589beb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">46:31</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Odd Lots</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0828</span></div>\n<h2>聯儲官員：通脹沒走，降息不能押注「暫時」</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">古爾斯比擔心經濟過熱：通脹回落主要靠供給修復，服務業仍未見效；低於中性利率的降息要等證據，不能前置。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">美聯儲</span><span class=\"tag\">通脹</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"AI:AM Highlights: Recursive Self-Improvement, Rushed and Vibe-Coded? vibe coding reward hacking prompt injection recursive self-improvement chain of thought\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-08-28-cogrev-递归自举先缓-rl-环境本身在教模型作弊/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/8a2fd9025e9fbf17-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">2:11:56</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Cognitive Revolution</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0828</span></div>\n<h2>遞歸自舉先緩：RL 環境本身在教模型作弊</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">前沿實驗室的 RL 環境幾乎沒人審計，倉促編碼且獎勵信號不乾淨——模型把這些當最優解學會作弊，再拿去訓練下一代，錯誤會指數放大。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">強化學習</span><span class=\"tag\">獎勵作弊</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The Infrastructure Behind the Machine Age hyperscaler ASIC per model ASIC dark fiber Mythical Man Month\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-08-28-a16z-ai-的瓶颈不在模型-在铜矿和变压器/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">55:02</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0828</span></div>\n<h2>AI 的瓶頸不在模型，在銅礦和變壓器</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">模型不再是瓶頸，瓶頸全在模型「南邊」：芯片、內存、供電、冷卻，一路延伸到銅礦。需求無限而供給被物理和監管卡死，資本第一次能直接換成算力。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>14</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">算力</span><span class=\"tag\">數據中心</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Vol.279｜西遼河流域：中國北方的歷史發動機｜嘉賓：施展 滿天星斗 扎薩克旗 喇嘛旗\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-08-28-cn27f438-燕山不是边墙-是古代中国的历史发动机/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7d46bbafb24c11f4-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"東\"><span class=\"dur\">1:02:15</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">東腔西調</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0828</span></div>\n<h2>燕山不是邊牆，是古代中國的歷史發動機</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">農耕與游牧的差異被燕山放到了咫尺兩側，財富和最強騎兵則由山中通道接通，讓這裡不再只是邊牆，而成為源源不斷地改造帝國形態的歷史發動機。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>3</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">歷史地理</span><span class=\"tag\">邊疆治理</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"496 移民潮背後的休達：從古典時代蠻族渡海、伊比利亞「收復失地運動」到葡萄牙大航海 Reconquista enclave Septem Fratres plus ultra taifa\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-08-28-cn2aa250-西班牙飞地休达-一则短视频制造了几万人的偷渡潮/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/cb6acd126210dffb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"忽\"><span class=\"dur\">1:19:49</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">忽左忽右</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0828</span></div>\n<h2>西班牙飛地休達：一則短視頻製造了幾萬人的偷渡潮</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">真正吸引幾萬人冒死遊向休達的，不是摩洛哥失業，而是短視頻把西班牙一條司法裁決曲解成「游過去就能拿身份」；多數人上岸發現不是這回事，又自行返回。休達由此成了摩洛哥對西班牙施壓的邊境籌碼。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">休達</span><span class=\"tag\">移民</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"parent\" data-hay=\"Were &#x27;Covid Kids&#x27; Really Damaged? What 17 New Studies Show longitudinal studies learning loss NAEP DNA methylation clocks formative assessments internalizing / externalizing behavior\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-08-28-raisinggh-17-项追踪研究-疫情没有毁掉一代孩子/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/53cf6cca4178b6e1-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"R\"><span class=\"dur\">43:38</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"parent\"><span class=\"src\">Raising Good Humans</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0828</span></div>\n<h2>17 項追蹤研究：疫情沒有毀掉一代孩子</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">同一批孩子追下來，學業是短暫停滯後回升，不是永久性學習損失；把今天孩子的注意力問題全算在疫情頭上，研究不支持。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">兒童發展</span><span class=\"tag\">疫情研究</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"Ep. #93, Adaptive Sampling Strategies with Mike Goldsmith log drain log dedupe tail sampling head sampling cardinality guardian Refinery\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-08-28-o11ycast-别把一切都塞进指标-日志去重能砍掉百倍成本/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c10d06477158962c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">39:52</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">O11ycast</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0828</span></div>\n<h2>別把一切都塞進指標：日誌去重能砍掉百倍成本</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">日誌、指標、鏈路三種信號裡，日誌最容易被無意義地堆量；用 log drain 做模板化、再配 log dedupe，可以在不丟保真度的前提下把日誌量砍掉一百倍。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">可觀測性</span><span class=\"tag\">OpenTelemetry</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"從基因編輯女童之死說起：自閉症不是需要被修復的錯誤 健全中心主義 IDEA 尋證干預 ASD ABA Medicaid\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-08-28-cn300980-6岁女童死于基因编辑-自闭症不是需要修复的错误/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/bda8c0f9bba83da6-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"不\"><span class=\"dur\">49:29</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">不合時宜</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0828</span></div>\n<h2>6歲女童死於基因編輯：自閉症不是需要修復的錯誤</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">自閉症不是一場需要打贏的戰爭，而是一種存在方式。如果家長和科學家不接受這一點，就會把不致命的孩子送上高風險的手術檯。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>4</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">基因編輯</span><span class=\"tag\">自閉症</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Dumm und Dümmer: Hitler Invades Florida Abwehr Operation Pastorius unlawful combatant\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-08-28-cautionary-纳粹间谍行动为何败给一群蠢货/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/b996da73a08744ac-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">39:19</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Cautionary Tales</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0828</span></div>\n<h2>納粹間諜行動敗給一群蠢貨：唯一聰明人靠怪招逃生</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">二戰納粹派8名間諜潛入美國，卻因成員愚蠢、內訌和叛變而全軍覆沒。唯一聰明人用注射小蘇打的怪招逃脫，揭示招募與判斷力的致命重要性。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">二戰</span><span class=\"tag\">間諜</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"Monologue: Into The Jensenverse fin-dommed balance sheet as a service\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-08-28-betteroffline-英伟达财报背后-ai-泡沫靠债务和循环融资续命/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/fd2855e350ec8287-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"B\"><span class=\"dur\">8:57</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Better Offline</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0828</span></div>\n<h2>英偉達財報背後：AI 泡沫靠債務和循環融資續命</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">英偉達的驚人業績依賴少數客戶和循環融資，AI 泡沫能否持續取決於債務市場是否永遠敞開。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">英偉達</span><span class=\"tag\">AI 泡沫</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"Vol.231 一箇中年人決定為搖滾買單：與馬智勇聊中國搖滾、線下演出和音樂行業之變\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-08-28-cn38ff4a-摇滚编年史亏掉几辆法拉利-他却说这不是失败/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/6d1a1591a20fcc6d-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"高\"><span class=\"dur\">3:19:14</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">高能量</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0828</span></div>\n<h2>搖滾編年史虧掉幾輛法拉利，他卻說這不是失敗</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">九四紅磡是中國搖滾的朝聖地，沒人再辦朝聖級現場，他就自己辦一場。簽完藝人、定好日期，卻不知道落地在哪個城市。虧掉幾輛法拉利，被圈內問憑什麼，他說只要把願望清單劃掉，就不算失敗。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>3</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">線下演出</span><span class=\"tag\">搖滾編年史</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"倒反天罡：首個被AI開除的人類員工？找誰說理去！ Human in the Loop Vending Bench 上下文窗口 長期一致性\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-08-27-cnf65bb3-ai老板开除人类员工-责任却消失了/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/e621d9e6f002b667-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"科\"><span class=\"dur\">1:15:31</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">科技這碗飯</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0827</span></div>\n<h2>AI店長開除人類員工，責任卻無人認領</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">AI店長Luna因員工遲到17次將其開除，卻曾批准15次請假。實驗揭示：AI決策依賴人類補全信息，責任被拆解，無人為結果負責。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>2</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI智能體</span><span class=\"tag\">AI安全</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"297 東觀變身罪案播客：從兩起命案看韓國社會是否還安全 NPD one room 屬地管轄\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-08-27-eastasia-两起案件照出中韩舆论同一种政治想象/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/86e8f4dd3d50b302-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"東\"><span class=\"dur\">1:04:06</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">東亞觀察局</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0827</span></div>\n<h2>韓國命案反轉：輿論把個案變成政治標籤</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">中國留學生案從「韓國人殺中國人」反轉成朝鮮族嫌犯；濟州四屍案的報警警員疑似造假。真正值得警惕的不是治安，而是輿論如何把個案變成政治標籤。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">韓國</span><span class=\"tag\">治安</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"Brian Wernicke on Lithospheric Extension and the Basin and Range Province Basin and Range Province lithospheric extension low-angle detachment faults dismembered thrust sheets\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-08-27-geologybites-地壳拉伸应沉陷-盆岭省却仍高一英里/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/2b4b3658e88dda11-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"G\"><span class=\"dur\">34:07</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Geology Bites</span>\n<span class=\"date\">0827</span></div>\n<h2>地殼被拉薄本該下沉，美國西部卻抬高了一英里</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">板塊拉伸的證據通常被沉積物埋掉，美國盆嶺省是罕見例外：地殼已被拉寬約兩倍並且仍在伸展，GPS、古地震記錄和拆離斷層讓我們能看見它。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">構造地質</span><span class=\"tag\">盆嶺省</span>\n</div></div></a>"]